# Definitions, anticipated questions and background notes. Status ai-draft / draft throughout.
# A definition's `at` names the first sentence in reading order that uses the term, and a few words of it that occur
# verbatim in the node (the build checks them); mentions of the term and its aliases are marked in the text
# automatically. Aliases are true synonyms only: inflections and the paper's own spellings ("Von-Misses",
# "Piola-Kirchoff", "instanteneous" are the paper's). "SLS" is deliberately not an alias of "standard linear solid":
# it occurs dozens of times and every mention would be dotted.

